(**********) vedikā kanakaprabhā || 113 ||

padmakundendu varṇābhaṃ daṇḍaṃ kṛṣṇājinaprabhaṃ |
mūlaṃ pāvakasaṃkāśaṃ rudrāsrtraṃ kathitaṃ mayā || 114 ||

brahmāstraṃ kamalaṃ jñeyaṃ lakṣaṇa 

